		font-size: 40px;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: #FFFFFF;
		margin-bottom: 8px;
	}
	.hero-tip {
		font-size: 12px;
		color: #FFFFFF;
	}
	.card {
		background-color: #FFFFFF;
		border-radius: 16px;
		padding: 14px 16px 12px 16px;
		margin-bottom: 10px;
